{"user": "I'm thinking c8 because it traps 4 white discs?", "user_ts": "2026-08-07T14:58:56.877986+00:00", "assistant": "c8 is tempting, but pause on the **open a8 corner**.\n\nBefore choosing it, ask:\n\n- After **c8**, what legal moves does White get around **a7 / b8 / a8**?\n- Are you giving White a way to take or force the **a8 corner**?\n- Does c8 leave White with several moves, or does another legal move leave White with fewer replies?\n\nIn the endgame, flipping 4 now is only good if those discs **stay yours** and don\u2019t give up a corner/mobility. Try looking at the lower-left corner area first.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-07T14:59:11.661001+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-07T14:59:14.163595+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Common Ground Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Common Ground Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Hint": 3, "Prompt": 3, "Pose Simplified Problem": 1, "Neutral Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Hint": 1.0, "Prompt": 1.0, "Pose Simplified Problem": 0.3333333333333333, "Neutral Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt", "Pose Simplified Problem"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"fina